### Test Auth - Register
POST https://localhost:7065/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newuser@pokestore.com",
  "password": "Test@12345",
  "confirmPassword": "Test@12345",
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe"
}

### Test Auth - Login
POST https://localhost:7065/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@pokestore.com",
  "password": "Test@12345"
}

### Test Auth - Get Profile (requires token from login)
GET https://localhost:7065/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>

### Get All Products
GET https://localhost:7065/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Product by ID
GET https://localhost:7065/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Search Products
GET https://localhost:7065/api/products/search?query=Pikachu
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Products by Category
GET https://localhost:7065/api/products/category/1
Content-Type: application/json

### PHASE 2: CART OPERATIONS (Requires authentication)

### Get Cart (empty initially)
GET https://localhost:7065/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

### Add Item to Cart
POST https://localhost:7065/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Add Another Item
POST https://localhost:7065/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 3,
  "quantity": 1
}

### Get Cart with Items
GET https://localhost:7065/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Cart Item Quantity
PUT https://localhost:7065/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5
}

### Get Cart Summary with Totals
GET https://localhost:7065/api/cart/summary
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

### Remove Item from Cart
DELETE https://localhost:7065/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

### Clear Entire Cart
DELETE https://localhost:7065/api/cart/clear
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

### PHASE 3: CHECKOUT & ORDER MANAGEMENT

### Validate Checkout (before payment)
POST https://localhost:7065/api/checkout/validate
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": "123 Main St, Springfield, IL 62701"
}

### Initiate Payment (creates PendingPayment order)
POST https://localhost:7065/api/checkout/initiate-payment
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": "123 Main St, Springfield, IL 62701",
  "billingAddress": "456 Oak Ave, Springfield, IL 62702"
}

### Confirm Payment (marks order as Paid)
POST https://localhost:7065/api/checkout/payment-confirmation
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1
}

### Get Order by ID
GET https://localhost:7065/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Order by Order Number
GET https://localhost:7065/api/orders/number/PO-20260605-1234
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

### Get User's Order History
GET https://localhost:7065/api/orders?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

### Get Order Invoice
GET https://localhost:7065/api/orders/1/invoice
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

### Update Order Status (Admin only)
PUT https://localhost:7065/api/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Shipped"
}

### PHASE 4: PAYMENT INTEGRATION & WEBHOOKS

### PayPal IPN Webhook Health Check
GET https://localhost:7065/api/paymentwebhook/paypal/health
Content-Type: application/json

### Simulate PayPal IPN Webhook - Successful Payment
POST https://localhost:7065/api/paymentwebhook/paypal/ipn
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-PAYPAL-TRANSMISSION-ID: test-webhook-123
X-PAYPAL-TRANSMISSION-SIG: base64_signature_here

mc_gross=65.00&txn_id=test_transaction_12345&payment_status=Completed&custom=1&txn_type=web_accept&payer_email=buyer@example.com&first_name=John&last_name=Doe

### Simulate PayPal IPN Webhook - Failed Payment
POST https://localhost:7065/api/paymentwebhook/paypal/ipn
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-PAYPAL-TRANSMISSION-ID: test-webhook-456
X-PAYPAL-TRANSMISSION-SIG: base64_signature_here

mc_gross=65.00&txn_id=test_transaction_failed&payment_status=Failed&custom=1&txn_type=web_accept&payer_email=buyer@example.com&first_name=John&last_name=Doe

### Simulate PayPal IPN Webhook - Refund
POST https://localhost:7065/api/paymentwebhook/paypal/ipn
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
X-PAYPAL-TRANSMISSION-ID: test-webhook-789
X-PAYPAL-TRANSMISSION-SIG: base64_signature_here

mc_gross=-65.00&txn_id=test_transaction_refunded&payment_status=Refunded&custom=1&txn_type=web_accept&reason_code=refund&payer_email=buyer@example.com&first_name=John&last_name=Doe

### E2E: Complete Checkout Flow
### Step 1: Add items to cart
POST https://localhost:7065/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Step 2: Validate checkout
POST https://localhost:7065/api/checkout/validate
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": "123 Main St, Springfield, IL 62701"
}

### Step 3: Initiate payment (creates order)
POST https://localhost:7065/api/checkout/initiate-payment
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shippingAddress": "123 Main St, Springfield, IL 62701",
  "billingAddress": "456 Oak Ave, Springfield, IL 62702"
}

### Step 4: PayPal processes payment and sends webhook (automated by PayPal)
### (In production, PayPal IPN would be sent automatically)

### Step 5: Check order status (should be Paid after webhook)
GET https://localhost:7065/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer <token_from_login>
Content-Type: application/json

### Swagger UI
GET https://localhost:7065/swagger

